<code>assert \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < index; this.get(i) == \old(this.get(i)) || (\old(this.get(i)) == null &amp;&amp; this.get(i) == null);</code>

This assert statement ensures that for every valid index less than the specified index, the element at that position remains unchanged or is null if it was originally null.
--------------------
<code>assert \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < index; this.get(i) == \old(this.get(i));</code>
